&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in Customer Success, Technical Account Management, Solutions Engineering, or Strategy Consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with F500 technology companies, SaaS platforms, or digital-first businesses at the exec level—ideally including high-growth and established tech companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand what it means to lead organization-wide change or adoption programs (multiple functions, hundreds of users) for a product that requires C-suite sponsorship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency with ability to understand and articulate AI/ML concepts, API integrations, and software implementation patterns across a set of diverse stakeholders—from developers and product managers to executives and end users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record managing a portfolio of accounts while maintaining strong relationships and driving measurable outcomes — you can run multiple enterprise motions in parallel without letting any account go quiet.&lt;/li&gt;
