&lt;li&gt;Passion for AI and interest in responsible development of advanced systems. You have built with Claude Code, automating your own workflows with agents, skills, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for bringing order to chaos and an enthusiastic &quot;roll up your sleeves&quot; mentality&lt;/li&gt;
