&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate complex buying centers and coach reps on multi-threaded engagement across technical, economic, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
